

# ── Release signing ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The app's identity for its entire life. Committed once, it is a key anybody
# who clones the repo can publish an update with — and it cannot be rotated,
# because Google Play binds the app to the certificate it was first signed
# with. Kept out of git and backed up somewhere that is not this laptop.
*.jks
*.keystore
